
Welcome to Cameo — any AMD card -> a working LLM box.

  cameo gpu-status       see your GPU's support tier (1/2/3)
  cameo pull tinyllama   fetch a small model that fits a 4 GB card
  cameo serve tinyllama  stand up an OpenAI-compatible endpoint
  cameo run tinyllama    run inference
  cameo pull --list      see model aliases and what's cached
  cameo --help           everything else

First time? Try:  cameo pull tinyllama && cameo serve tinyllama

Running from the USB? Install Cameo permanently to this machine:
  cameo-install          dry run — shows the plan, changes nothing
  cameo-install --commit installs to a disk you pick (erases it)

Docs & source: https://github.com/korbin/cameo
